  <section class="setting setting--tint" data-reveal>
    <div class="court">
      <div class="setting__head"><h2>What a group is actually like</h2></div>
      <div class="prose" style="max-inline-size:46rem">
        <p>Somebody makes coffee. Somebody reads a passage — usually the one preached on the previous Sunday. Then people talk about it for forty minutes, badly and honestly, and often about something else entirely by the end.</p>
        <p>Nobody is asked to read aloud, pray aloud, or know anything. Attendance is not registered and nobody rings you if you miss three weeks, though somebody may well ask how you are.</p>
      </div>
